{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.not_orderIndependent_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.not_orderIndependent_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L154-L162","doc":"Distinct like-pair scalars already break arrangement-independence. With\n`InterfaceScalar.charge_independence_iff` (`L_pp = L_nn ↔ h = 0 ↔ q = 1`) this\nsays the chain is well defined only in the classical limit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.orderIndependent_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.orderIndependent_iff","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L137-L152","doc":"**The chain bond sum is arrangement-independent exactly when the three bond\nscalars coincide.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.eq_of_orderIndependent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.eq_of_orderIndependent","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L124-L135","doc":"The two `A = 3` rearrangements force all three bond scalars to coincide. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_npn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_npn","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L120-L122","doc":"`npn` — the same nucleus, rearranged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_nnp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_nnp","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L116-L118","doc":"`nnp` — the hard-coded arrangement at `A = 3`, `Z = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_pnp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_pnp","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L112-L114","doc":"`pnp` — the same nucleus, rearranged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_ppn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_ppn","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L108-L110","doc":"`ppn` — the hard-coded arrangement at `A = 3`, `Z = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_const","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L89-L100","doc":"With one scalar on every bond, the sum counts bonds and forgets the\narrangement entirely. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_cons_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_cons_cons","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L85-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L83-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum_nil","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L81-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondSum","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L71-L75","doc":"The linear-chain bond sum over the adjacent pairs of an arrangement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ChainBondOrderDependence.bondOf","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/ChainBondOrderDependence.lean#L66-L69","doc":"The scalar attached to an adjacent pair: like pairs get `Lpp` / `Lnn`,\nunlike pairs get `Lpn`. `true` is a proton. ","signatureChunk":0}]}